---

<!doctype html>
<html>
    <style>
        .container {
            padding: 80px 0;
            max-width: 960px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            text-align: center;
            width: 100%;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .cards-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 1.5rem;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            padding: 2rem 0;
        }
        .container p {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        h5 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            line-height: 1.2;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--black);
        }
        h6 {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            line-height: 1.2;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--accent);
        }
        .card {
            max-width: calc(25% - 1.5rem);
        }
        h3 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
        }
    </style>

    <body>
        <div class="container">
            <h5
                style="text-align: center; font-size: 42px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; width: 100%; font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
				font-style: italic; "
            >
                Event Offerings
            </h5>

            <p>
                The events combine hands-on cooking, cultural appreciation,
                luxury presentation, storytelling, and destination and culinary
                tourism.
